  ("How much does AC repair cost in Brampton?", "AC repair in Brampton is quoted in writing after diagnosis, so the price depends on the failed part. Capacitors and contactors are modest repairs, a compressor or evaporator coil costs far more, and if replacement is the better value a cold-climate heat pump starts at $5,500 installed."),
  ("Can you do emergency AC repair in Brampton during a heat wave?", "Yes. We take cooling calls evenings, weekends and holidays, give urgent no-cooling calls priority during a heat wave and tell you a realistic window rather than a promised arrival time."),
  ("Why does my AC cool the basement but not the upstairs?", "Cold air sinks and the basement sits closest to the furnace, so it gets the first and coldest air. Partially closing basement dampers helps a little, while a ductless unit for the suite and a properly sized system for the upper floors fixes it for good."),
  ("Can a basement apartment in Brampton have its own air conditioning?", "Yes, and a single-zone ductless heat pump is the usual way to do it. The suite gets its own cooling and heating with its own remote, and the main house AC no longer has to serve a floor it was never sized for."),
  ("Is it worth replacing my old AC with a heat pump in Brampton?", "If the air conditioner is past 12 years and the repair is major, usually yes. A cold-climate heat pump cools like central air, heats the house for most of the winter, and a qualifying model may earn a Home Renovation Savings Program rebate, commonly up to $2,000 for a gas-heated home. Confirm eligibility before installation, since program terms can change."),
